# Generated matplotlib charts imported from the FOSDEM deck. These are plot
# exports, not hand-edited source: the DFS chart alone is ~181k lines because a
# strip plot emits one <use> element per data point (~60k of them). Treating
# them as text makes `git diff`, `git blame`, and `git log -p` unusable in this
# directory for no benefit, since nobody reviews an SVG line by line.
#
# `-diff` keeps them versioned exactly as-is while telling git not to attempt a
# textual diff. Regenerate from the experiment notebooks rather than editing.
talks/*/assets/*.svg -diff linguist-generated=true
